# Build context for Dockerfile.demo is the repo root. Keep secrets and bulk out of the image.
.git
.github
# Both spellings on purpose: `az acr build` packs the context with its own matcher, where `**/.env` matches
# a .env in a subfolder but NOT the one at the top level — the root .env (real keys) was uploaded to the
# registry's build storage on the first run because of that. Never rely on the `**/` form alone.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/logs
**/*.tsbuildinfo
docs
reference
rag.md
test.py
